# 🎬 AI Watch Spaces – Interactive Social Watch Platform

An AI-powered social watch platform built using the MERN stack that allows users to watch content together in synchronized virtual rooms, interact through real-time chat, and receive AI-powered assistance.

## 🚀 Project Overview

AI Watch Spaces creates a shared entertainment experience where multiple users can join a virtual watch room, watch videos together, communicate in real time, and interact with an AI Co-Pilot for contextual questions and trivia.

## ✨ Key Features

- **User Authentication:** Secure registration and login using JWT.
- **Watch Spaces:** Create and join virtual watch rooms.
- **Invite System:** Share room invite codes with friends.
- **Synchronized Playback:** Coordinate video playback between participants.
- **Real-Time Chat:** Communicate with other participants using Socket.IO.
- **AI Co-Pilot:** Ask questions and receive contextual answers about the content.
- **Interactive Voting:** Participate in voting on available content variations.
- **Room Management:** Host controls for managing and ending watch sessions.
- **Session History:** Track watch sessions and user interactions.
- **Admin Features:** Manage content and timeline metadata.

